<title>
Thermostat Heater System Description
</title>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1621004001">
<title>
Thermostat Heater Construction
</title>
<ptxt>
This thermostat is equipped with an electric heater (1) for heating wax (2) and open / close of the valve (3) is operated energizing the heater controlled by ECM. Degree of the valve opening is controlled to optimize the coolant temperature.
</ptxt>
